 essure-just curiosity-driven play. Held in WonderLab \\(or sometimes outdo
 ors weather permitting\\)\, the space is set up for exploration with a var
 iety of rotating materials and stations. There will be one main activity/i
 nstallment/manipulative for the month that will be brought out every Thurs
 day. This will rotate with the month and the month's theme. Recommended Ag
 es: Designed for children ages 6 - 10\, but siblings are welcome. Dates: W
 eekly on Thursdays Times: 4 - 5:45pm Event Price: Free for Members / Free 
 with Museum Admission Admission Prices:Member: FREENon-member: $14.50 Acce
 ss pass: $5
