BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fresh Air Fridays: Board & Brush DIY Woodcrafting Workshop
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260619T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260619T200000
UID:260608lPE3UB_TFk2TkANFesJdpg
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Oliver Winery for a creative evening outdoors as pa
 rt of our Fresh Air Fridays series! We’re partnering with Board & Brush 
 Bloomington for a hands-on DIY woodcrafting workshop designed for all skil
 l levels with no experience needed. During this guided session\, you’ll 
 learn the basics of rustic wood crafting while creating your own custom mi
 ni tray project. Board & Brush will walk you through simple techniques\, o
 ffer creative tips\, and help you bring your design to life from start to 
 finish. Each guest will create a pre-stained wood tray \\(approx. 8” x 1
 2”\\) complete with metal handles and your choice of stencil design: Win
 e a Little\, Love More\, YUM\, or Happy Hour. All paint\, materials\, and 
 tools are included. Guests will also receive a complimentary glass of wine
  to enjoy during the event\, along with a free bonus gift\, a set of bambo
 o charcuterie utensils. Wine will be available for purchase by the glass o
 r bottle throughout the evening. Whether you’re planning a fun night out
  with friends\, a date night\, or just looking to try something new\, this
  is the perfect way to sip\, craft\, and unwind in a beautiful outdoor set
 ting. Capacity is limited\, so advance reservations are strongly encourage
 d. Be sure to sign up using the attached link to reserve your spot
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1312006324205295/
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
