BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dine Out for the Library at DaVinci and Mona
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260625T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260625T210000
UID:260609P3Khhifls0SOs0uTM65LcA
DESCRIPTION:Dine out for the Friends of the Library! Enjoy a delicious din
 ner at Da Vinci (250 S. Washington Street\, Bloomington) on Tuesdays\, Ju
 ne 16 and 23\, and Thursdays\, June 18 and 25\, from 5–9 PM. Choose thei
 r hand-crafted Neapolitan pizza baked in a wood-fired oven\, or enjoy a la
 rge selection of classic Italian pastas with homemade sauces and fresh sal
 ads. Or visit Mona Bar & Lounge (250 S. Washington Street\, Suite 1\, Bloo
 mington) on Thursdays\, June 18 and 25\, from 5 PM–12 AM. Mona is a one-
 of-a-kind destination in Bloomington and the newest cocktail bar and loung
 e in the community. Set in a cozy yet elevated space with a subtle speakea
 sy influence\, Mona is designed to bring people together through a curated
  menu\, exceptional cocktails\, and intentional hospitality. Show your fly
 er and Da Vinci and Mona will donate 20% of your bill to the Friends of th
 e Library to help make amazing Library programs possible.
LOCATION:Da Vinci
URL:http://mcpl.info/dineout
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
